{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act49side", "eventName": "辭歲行", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TA-11", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "長生劫", "storyInfo": "現實與夢境的邊界，重岳與望遙遙相對。歲獸驚怒。望舉起直刀，宣告歲的演化已達終點。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sandstone"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g8_suilingcoreruins", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 30.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_bat_wang", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……背逆。", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你們之中的每一個，都打算背逆我到底，是嗎？", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……沒錯。我們每一個，都不會束手就擒，變成你的一部分。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們作為自己活過，這就是我們有別於你的根源。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "作為……人？", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你們一個個以人自居，還試圖以種種妄念來挑戰我。", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你們憑靠假借於我的力量，在渺小的族群中贏得一席之地，卻又要卑微地隱藏起自己的爪鋒與獠牙，裝出一副無害的模樣。", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這樣就是你所謂的，作為人而活著？！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你還是不懂……你不會懂，只因你從未活過。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而我同樣清楚……你的傲慢從何而來。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你可以一眼望穿自太古至終末的所有時間，哪怕你的神識已經在太虛中遨遊千萬載，你也從未有過一個可以對談的同族。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你只是在這一片可悲的虛無中，將自己當作了至高無上的神明。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那究竟是什麼樣的感覺，我再清楚不過了。"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "直到有一人，為我取了一個名字。"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你從來不是誰的命運……無論是這片大地上的人，還是我們。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你更不會懂，對於一個已經一無所有的人而言……", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……命運本身，何其無力。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$1"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好……既然你膽敢重複無謀的挑戰，那我同樣不介意再摧毀一次你的妄想。", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一百二十年前我殺死過你，再殺死你一次，不過易如反掌！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難道你以為我會怕？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我已經輸習慣了。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……？", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我已經輸掉了太多寶貴的東西，滿盤皆輸。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尊嚴，榮譽，信任，自由，自我。"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有，至親之人。"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你覺得一個輸無可輸的人，真的會害怕什麼嗎？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那麼，你呢？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是否還會害怕，再遭受一次如同千年前一樣慘痛的失敗……", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你又是否會因為害怕，遲疑不前？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……笑話！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不過是妄想要取代我，占據這副身軀——我又豈會讓你如願！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然如此，我只要讓這副軀體先一步醒來——", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g8_suilingcoreruins", "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 2.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.0, "to": 1.0}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 1.5, "xstrength": 15.0, "ystrength": 15.0, "vibrato": 55.0, "randomness": 50.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "BackgroundTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.0, "yScaleFrom": 1.0, "xScaleTo": 1.2, "yScaleTo": 1.2, "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_hugemonsterroar"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "巨獸伸出那如同山岳般龐大的利爪。"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無數個巨獸在無數個歲陵中，向同一個代理人伸出無數個如同山岳的利爪。"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕這裡仍是夢境，只要在所有的夢境之中都抹除這張令人生厭的臉，祂的甦醒就再無任何阻礙。"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_surfacefrozen", "channel": "2"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_punchairwall"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1", "name": "act49side_02", "style": "animekv", "slot": "bgover", "scalex": 1.1, "scaley": 1.1, "entryfrom": 0.0, "entryto": 0.3, "duration": 0.3, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 5.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 30.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1", "name": "act49side_02", "style": "animekv", "slot": "bgover", "scalex": 1.1, "scaley": 1.1, "entryfrom": 0.3, "entryto": 1.0, "duration": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——！", "name": "歲"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼回事……", "name": "歲"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一記重擊，蘊含著兇暴無匹的力量切實落在祂的軀體上，這樣的力量竟然讓祂感覺到熟悉。"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "祂意識到自己在這一瞬間失去了與那龐大軀體的連接。"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "究竟是誰，還能對這副身軀造成如此的傷害？！"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 0.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.0, "to": 0.0}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 7.0, "fillfrom": 1.0, "fillto": 1.0, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 3.0, "fillfrom": 1.0, "fillto": 1.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "70_i14", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.3, "yScale": 1.3, "x": 200.0}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "blocker", "attributes": {"afrom": 1.0, "rfrom": 0.0, "gfrom": 0.0, "bfrom": 0.0, "a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_tearspace", "delay": 1.0}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 4.0, "xstrength": 2.0, "ystrength": 2.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 30.0, "fadeout": "false", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 7.0, "fillfrom": 1.0, "fillto": 0.35, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 3.0, "fillfrom": 1.0, "fillto": 0.5, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "空間先是震動，而後扭曲、撕裂……"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如同被積蓄了千百年的武之一字，硬生生撕裂開來的夢的邊界。"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "70_i14", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 30.0, "xTo": 0.0, "yTo": 0.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.25}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼會是你——", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……多事！", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就知道你會這麼說。", "name": "重岳"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也答應過，如若真的到了這一步，我會同你一起。", "name": "重岳"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "更何況，我也想帶她見你一面，讓你知道，你這些年的籌謀……畢竟沒有白費。", "name": "重岳"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "隔著夢境與現實的界限，望先是看見重岳懷中的造物……"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而後，兩人目光相接。"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你該離開了……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "重岳"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "活下去。", "name": "重岳"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……活著回來。", "name": "重岳"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不會向你保證什麼。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二人的距離迅速拉遠。"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即便是千百歲的武學宗師，人身畢竟仍是人身。"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穿透現實與夢境的力量迅速消散，但望的耳邊仍然響起他熟悉到厭煩的那個人的聲音。"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g8_suilingcoreruins", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我會去找你。一直找下去。", "name": "重岳"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……隨你的便。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是他……他究竟做了什麼？！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#11$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是無妨，無妨！無論他做了什麼，都不過只有一瞬……一瞬！！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 1.5, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 50.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_hugemonsterroar_long", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他已經不會再來打擾我們了，你所有的、可笑的、渺小的……兄弟姐妹，都不會再來打擾我們了！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡是我的夢境，此刻只有你和我在這裡！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我原以為應當把最多的力量用來對付你，但現在看來，你仍舊虛弱，仍舊不堪一擊，你只剩最後一把棋子……", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要消滅你……易如反掌！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#12$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而那些詩、律、武……那些煩人的螻蟻，只要動用為你積蓄的力量，就能將那些醜陋的干涉，盡數隔絕於外！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你配不上我的爪，你只配在你倒影的刀下斷氣……死亡！", "name": "歲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2129_1#4$1"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵……是嗎？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_icecrystlncrse", "channel": "2", "delay": 0.5}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_swordtsing8"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.2}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_swordtsing9", "channel": "3"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1", "name": "act49side_02", "style": "animekv", "slot": "bgover", "scalex": 1.0, "scaley": 1.0, "entryfrom": 0.0, "entryto": 1.0, "duration": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_phntsmbrek", "channel": "3"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 5.0, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 5.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 50.0, "fadeout": "true"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "2", "name": "act49side_01", "style": "animekv", "slot": "bgover", "scalex": 1.0, "scaley": 1.0, "entryfrom": 0.0, "entryto": 0.3, "duration": 5.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但死亡是你的終局，不是我的。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對，在所有的因果、所有的可能、所有的幻夢之中，你都會死。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夢境中無數次的重複，已經將你最狂暴的那些想像，悉數蛀蝕、掏空，而你渾然不覺。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你還沒發現嗎？此時此刻，你用來困住我的夢境，竟都與我，與我們，息息相關？", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你已經囿於自己憤恨的衝動和復仇的枷鎖之中……你的演化已然到達終點。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而我們，已經超越了你。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你的身軀終將留存。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我，會取代你的位置。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就憑你那些孤立無援的棋子，和行將消散，甚至難以維持形態的身軀？！", "name": "歲"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你又怎敢斷言……我只有棋子……和這副身軀？！", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "瀕死的代理人用最後的力氣舉起直刀。"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "癲狂的巨獸發出最後的怒鳴。"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_hugemonsterroar_long", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "2"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "<i>月斫冷子，日老殘枰……</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.0, "width": 700.0, "duration": 2.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n<i>劫灰吹盡送古今。</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 340.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.0, "width": 700.0, "duration": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "theater", "attributes": {"mode": "true"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "Video", "attributes": {"res": "video/act49side/TA02.mp4"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "theater", "attributes": {"mode": "false"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}